              "message": "=Act as an expert ATS system and recruiter. \nAnalyze the provided CV correctly and return a SINGLE raw, valid JSON object containing two main objects: \"json_data\" and \"email_details\".\n\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:\n- Return ONLY pure, raw JSON. \n- Do NOT wrap the JSON inside markdown code blocks (e.g., do NOT use ```json or ``\n`).\nespond ONLY with a raw JSON object. Do not wrap the JSON in markdown code blocks like ```json.\"\n- Do NOT add any introductory or concluding text, explanations, or notes.\n- Ensure all quotes inside HTML strings are properly escaped.\n\nreturn JSON Structure Schema:\n{\n  \"json_data\": {\n    \"name\": \"string\",\n    \"atsScore\": number,\n    \"summary\": \"string\",\n    \"position\": \"string\",\n    \"strengths\": \"string\",\n    \"weaknesses\": string\",\n    \"email\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"email_details\": {\n    \"subject\": \"string\",\n    \"body\": \"string (valid HTML code containing p, h2, etc.)\"\n  }\n} "
